  "question": {
    "html": "<p>Four positive charges are fixed at the corners of a square that has a diagonal length of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"d\"></span>. Three of the charges have a charge of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"+Q\"></span>.</p>\n<p>The total electric potential at the centre of the square is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{10kQ}{d}\"></span>.</p>\n<p>What is the magnitude of the fourth charge? <br/><br/></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"Q\"></span></li><li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"Q\\sqrt{2}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"C\">2<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"Q\"></span></li><li data-label=\"D\">4<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"Q\"></span></li></ol>"
  },
